# === Identity documents — never in this repo ===
# E6-S9 needs a real Aadhaar QR to test signature verification against, and a real
# one belongs to a real person. Git history is permanent and this repo has a remote,
# so the fixtures live outside the working tree entirely (see docs/stories E6-S9).
# These patterns are a second line of defence, not the plan.
**/aadhaar*
**/aadhar*
**/*-identity-document.*
fixtures-private/
